ne/godot/pulls/118853","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118853","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118853.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118853.patch","merged_at":"2026-05-12T17:37:51Z"},"body":"Follow-up to #107943\r\nThat PR made built-in resources generate unique ID and get path assigned. It had 2 problems:\r\n- The generated unique ID wasn't assigned, so ResourceFormatText was re-creating it anyway\r\n- The unique ID in text resources consists of the resource type, not only the generated part\r\n\r\nThis caused the Resource's path to be changed when saving scene, making the paths assigned in #107943 effectively temporary.\r\n\r\nThis PR ensures that proper ID is generated and assigned, and that the final path is _unique_, to avoid errors when creating multiple Resources.\r\nFixes #116551","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118853/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"time